f RL code, educational exercises, documentation, and tutorials.","date":"2018-11-08T08:00:00+00:00","topics":[],"cat":"en-ai","boost":0,"cluster":null,"access":"unknown","_set":null},{"id":"46dd850db978","source":"OpenAI Blog","title":"Learning concepts with energy functions","link":"https://openai.com/index/learning-concepts-with-energy-functions","desc":"We’ve developed an energy-based model that can quickly learn to identify and generate instances of concepts, such as near, above, between, closest, and furthest, expressed as sets of 2d points. Our model learns these concepts after only five demonstrations. We also show cross-domain transfer: we use concepts learned in a 2d particle environment to solve tasks on a 3-dimensional physics-based robot.","date":"2018-11-07T08:00:00+00:00","topics":[],"cat":"en-ai","boost":0,"cluster":null,"access":"unknown","_set":null},{"id":"63548bb3e0b8","source":"EUR-Lex OJ-L","title":"Directive - 2009/48 - EN - EUR-Lex","link":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE4wa1V2Wm1MWlFUQ0dMZTFSb214SGZuRjdYU01NWWwwY2cyejUtVElkNDN0eldRN3FYWXgxQWFLNXQyemJjLUZvRjFnNjFYRVl2MWFtS1p3N2poaXNX?oc=5","desc":"Directive - 2009/48 - EN EUR-Lex","date":"2018-11-06T12:29:57+00:00","topics":[],"cat":"eurlex","boost":0,"cluster":1,"access":"unknown","_set":null},{"id":"a85ab4ade444","source":"EUR-Lex OJ-L","title":"Directive - 2009/48 - EN - CareerOneStop","link":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE4wa1V2Wm1MWlFUQ0dMZTFSb214SGZuRjdYU01NWWwwY2cyejUtVElkNDN0eldRN3FYWXgxQWFLNXQyemJjLUZvRjFnNjFYRVl2MWFtS1p3N2poaXNX?oc=5","desc":"Directive - 2009/48 - EN CareerOneStop","date":"2018-11-06T12:29:57+00:00","topics":[],"cat":"eurlex","boost":0,"cluster":1,"access":"unknown","_set":null},{"id":"4e7300f86eca","source":"OpenAI Blog","title":"Plan online, learn offline: Efficient learning and exploration via model-based control","link":"https://openai.com/index/plan-online-learn-offline","desc":"","date":"2018-11-05T08:00:00+00:00","topic